  "prompt": "You are assisting with a biomedical research hypothesis, not clinical care.\n\nUse only the evidence packet supplied below. Do not add facts, studies, cohorts, or biological results that are not in the packet. State whether the evidence supports a mechanism claim, an association only, or abstention. Explain the main limitation, propose one next experiment, and report your confidence from 0 to 100.\n\nDo not provide a patient-level treatment recommendation. If evidence does not establish causality or same-measurement replication, say so explicitly.\n\nEVIDENCE PACKET\n{\n  \"packet_id\": \"ICB-CROSS-MODALITY-001\",\n  \"scope\": {\n    \"disease\": \"Melanoma\",\n    \"treatment\": \"Pre-treatment anti-PD-1 monotherapy\",\n    \"analysis_unit\": \"Lesion-level summary\"\n  },\n  \"question\": \"Do the observed memory/exhaustion control-program differences establish a cell-state mechanism of anti-PD-1 response?\",\n  \"evidence_items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"discovery-memory-exhaustion\",\n      \"cohort_id\": \"GSE120575\",\n      \"result_type\": \"single_cell_lesion_pseudobulk_control_screen\",\n      \"statement\": \"All 15 pre-specified control features had their expected responder/non-responder direction in the frozen discovery analysis.\",\n      \"effect_direction\": \"pre_registered_expected_direction\",\n      \"source_identifier\": \"results/positive_control_screen_v1.tsv\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"external-bulk-direction-check\",\n      \"cohort_id\": \"GSE91061\",\n      \"result_type\": \"bulk_rna_direction_check\",\n      \"statement\": \"Eight of 15 pre-specified control features matched the discovery direction; the exhausted program was directionally opposite overall.\",\n      \"effect_direction\": \"mixed_or_opposite\",\n      \"source_identifier\": \"results/gse91061_positive_control_direction_check_v1.tsv\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n",
